{"nodes": [{"id": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame00301", "label": "Test Frame 00301 - Siren Camera Infrared Night View of Broiler House", "file_type": "image", "source_file": "Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/img_test/frame00301.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Grayscale infrared CCTV still (1920x1080) from an overhead poultry-house camera labelled 1080P-IPC-Siren, timestamped 2022-02-22 08:14:16. Shows roughly 100-150 young broilers on a litter floor, a horizontal suspended feed line crossing the frame with five circular pan feeders, and a dark drinker/cable line arcing across the lower third. Serves as a held-out test image for the chicken behaviour detection pipeline."}, {"id": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame00301_camera_1080p_ipc_siren", "label": "Camera Channel 1080P-IPC-Siren", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/img_test/frame00301.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "One of at least three distinct named camera channels burned into the test-set overlays (Siren, PIR, Gas). The Siren channel produces monochrome IR frames of a pen with lighter-coloured litter and smaller birds, giving the dataset a separate visual domain from the other channels."}, {"id": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame00301_infrared_night_capture", "label": "Infrared / Low-Light Grayscale Capture Mode", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/img_test/frame00301.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The Siren frames are fully desaturated with flat IR-style illumination, meaning the model must localise birds from texture and silhouette alone with no colour cue. Including such frames in the test split deliberately checks that the detector does not depend on the white-plumage-against-grey-litter colour contrast available in the daylight/colour channels."}, {"id": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame00301_pan_feeder_line", "label": "Suspended Pan Feeder Line", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/img_test/frame00301.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A rigid horizontal supply pipe carrying five evenly spaced circular pan feeders bisects every Siren frame. It is a fixed scene landmark: constant across frames, it provides an implicit spatial reference for locating feeding zones and can be a source of false positives because its bright radial spokes resemble bird outlines."}, {"id": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame00301_feeding_cluster_behavior", "label": "Feeding Cluster Behaviour Around Pans", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/img_test/frame00301.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Birds form dense radial rosettes with heads pointed inward at each pan, the visual signature of active feeding. This head-in ring arrangement is the behaviour class the analysis pipeline is expected to recognise, and it is the hardest configuration to segment because adjacent birds touch and partially occlude one another."}, {"id": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame00301_flock_dispersion_pattern", "label": "Flock Dispersion and Spatial Distribution", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/img_test/frame00301.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Outside the feeder rosettes the birds are loosely and unevenly scattered, with a sparse empty band across the lower half of the pen. Uniformity of dispersion is a standard welfare/comfort indicator, so per-frame bird positions are the raw signal a downstream density or heat-map analysis would consume."}, {"id": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame00301_fisheye_lens_distortion", "label": "Wide-Angle / Fisheye Lens Distortion", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/img_test/frame00301.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Straight structures such as the feed pipe bow visibly and the pen boundary curves at the frame edges, evidence of a wide-angle security lens. The resulting scale gradient means apparent bird size varies strongly with image position, so a counting model cannot assume a constant object scale across the frame."}, {"id": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame00301_multi_camera_test_dataset", "label": "img_test Multi-Camera Held-Out Frame Set", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/img_test/frame00301.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The img_test directory holds sequentially numbered frameNNNNN.png stills sampled from several CCTV recordings rather than one continuous clip. Mixing camera channels, dates, illumination modes and bird ages in one evaluation folder is a deliberate choice to measure generalisation instead of memorisation of a single scene."}], "edges": [{"source": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame00301", "target": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame00301_camera_1080p_ipc_siren", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/img_test/frame00301.png", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame00301", "target": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame00301_infrared_night_capture", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/img_test/frame00301.png", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame00301", "target": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame00301_pan_feeder_line", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/img_test/frame00301.png", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame00301", "target": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame00301_feeding_cluster_behavior", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/Chicken-Behavior-Analysis-main/img_test/frame00301.png", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame00301", "target": "chicken_behavior_analysis_main_chicken_behavior_analysis_main_img_test_frame00301_flock_dispersion_pattern", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score"